  {
   "title": "The Rim falls",
   "date": "25–26 ABY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "Ithor is burned, Obroa-skai's libraries taken, Garqi and Duro overrun; the Hutts bargain and are conquered anyway. The invasion comes down the Perlemian and the Hydian like water through a broken dam, and the refugees arrive on Coruscant before the news does.",
