  {
   "title": "The fall of Coruscant",
   "date": "27 ABY",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Coruscant",
    "w": 3400
   },
   "text": "Coruscant falls and is reshaped into Yuuzhan'tar, the Vong's new homeworld. What is left of the government gathers at Mon Calamari and, with the Imperial Remnant and the Hapans, becomes the Galactic Federation of Free Alliances. The New Republic ends here; the Galactic Alliance begins.",
