  {
   "title": "Ebaq 9, and the end",
   "date": "28–29 ABY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "The Vong warmaster is lured into the Deep Core and destroyed at Ebaq 9; Bilbringi and the Remnant hold; the living world Zonama Sekot arrives over Coruscant. The recapture of Coruscant ends the war with the galaxy's map redrawn — hundreds of worlds gone, and the Alliance ruling what remains.",
